  "title": "Spruced-Up Canned Corned Beef Hash",
  "description": "This canned corned beef hash recipe is spruced up with bacon, mushrooms, cheese, and eggs in a quick, one-skillet meal that is easy to customize.",
  "authors": [
    "Allrecipes Member"
  ],
